  "html": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Meet Aashish Chittora, a dynamic businessman from our beautiful city who has discovered an unwavering passion for cycling. </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aashish&#8217;s favorite quote, &#8220;<em>I know good things are coming because I am making them happen,</em>&#8221; perfectly encapsulates his outlook on life. Despite not being involved in sports during his school days, Aashish&#8217;s journey took a thrilling turn when he stumbled upon the captivating cycling activities shared by his friend Kapesh Ajaria, a dedicated member of our very own Udaipur Cycling Club. </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Driven by curiosity and a thirst for personal transformation, Aashish took his first pedal strokes, starting with a modest distance of just 5 kilometers. Though he faced initial challenges, he persisted, gradually increasing his distances to 10, 20, and an incredible 30 kilometers! </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">But that was just the beginning of Aashish&#8217;s cycling journey. Ignited by the vibrant community and endless opportunities offered by the Udaipur Cycling Club, he wholeheartedly embraced the spirit of exploration and participation. Aashish became an active participant in various events organized by the club, including the CycloRun, Udaipur Duathlon, TAAVDO 2022, and many more. </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It was during TAAVDO 2022, a mere six months into his cycling journey, that Aashish truly soared. Pouring his heart and soul into the event, he exceeded his own expectations and secured an impressive top-three position!  This incredible achievement not only revealed his inner strength but also ignited an insatiable hunger for new challenges. Aashish went on to conquer a remarkable 640-kilometer ride in DIU and triumphantly completed his first full marathon at the Tata Mumbai Marathon! </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aashish is immensely grateful to the Udaipur Cycling Club for providing a nurturing platform that has helped him evolve as a cyclist and as an individual. United by a shared passion, the club&#8217;s unwavering support and motivation have propelled Aashish on this extraordinary journey of growth and self-discovery. </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Now, with the highly anticipated TAAVDO 2023 on the horizon, Aashish sets his sights on a new and audacious goal: achieving Ultra Points. Fuelled by his unwavering determination and indomitable spirit, he is eager to test his limits and push beyond boundaries! </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Join us in showering Aashish Chittora with applause and encouragement as he embarks on this remarkable adventure, showcasing the boundless strength and resilience that lies within each of us. Together, let&#8217;s witness the power of dreams and experience the true essence of TAAVDO 2023 through the incredible journey of this extraordinary cyclist! </p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-visual-portfolio alignwide\">\n<div class=\"vp-portfolio vp-uid-10e46e72 vp-id-Z4kl6x\"\n\tdata-vp-layout=\"masonry\" data-vp-content-source=\"images\" data-vp-items-style=\"default\" data-vp-items-click-action=\"popup_gallery\" data-vp-items-gap=\"4\" data-vp-items-gap-vertical=\"4\" data-vp-pagination=\"load-more\" data-vp-next-page-url=\"\" data-vp-masonry-columns=\"3\" >\n\t<div class=\"vp-portfolio__preloader-wrap\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vp-portfolio__preloader\">\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"eager\" src=\"/wp-content/plugins/visual-portfolio/assets/images/logo-dark.svg\" alt=\"Visual Portfolio, Posts &amp; Image Gallery for WordPress\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-skip-lazy>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"vp-portfolio__items-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"vp-portfolio__items vp-portfolio__items-style-default vp-portfolio__items-show-overlay-hover\">\n\n\t\t<div\t\tclass=\"vp-portfolio__item-wrap vp-portfolio__item-uid-c288a4b7\" data-vp-filter=\"\" \t\t>\n\t\t\t<template class=\"vp-portfolio__item